 r←GetNewestPerMajor registryPath;list;majors;uniqueMajors;m;buff
⍝ Returns the package IDs of the newest release in every major version line.
⍝ That is exactly the set a README is ever wanted for: only the newest release of a line is
⍝ rendered, so fetching anything else would be work nobody looks at.
 r←⍬
 :If 0=≢list←1 Reg.GetAllPackages registryPath      ⍝ [;1]=package ID, [;2]=publishing date
     :Return
 :EndIf
 majors←Reg.RemoveMinorAndPatch¨list[;1]
 uniqueMajors←∪majors
 :For m :In uniqueMajors
     buff←list[⍸majors≡¨⊂m;]
     r,←⊂⊃buff[⊃⌽⍋buff[;2];1]                       ⍝ Dates are strings here, so ⍋ rather than ⌈/
 :EndFor
